content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Manager",
      "description": "Oversees consulting projects and manages relationships with clients."
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Organization representative seeking consulting services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Organization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Organization",
      "description": "The client’s company or institution being analyzed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Consulting Project",
      "description": "Engagement between consultants and client to deliver improvements.",
      "attributes": [
        "Consultant",
        "Client"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Consultant",
      "description": "Provides professional advice and creates project proposals."
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Report",
      "description": "Summary of project status and progress submitted to the manager."
    },
    {
      "name": "Proposal",
      "description": "Document outlining improvement strategies and an engagement plan.",
      "attributes": [
        "Engagement Plan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Engagement Plan",
      "description": "Detailed plan describing project scope, deliverables, and timeline."
    },
    {
      "name": "Analysis Session",
      "description": "Collaborative meeting where data is reviewed and discussed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Reporter",
      "description": "Collects and analyzes data to support consulting recommendations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Report",
      "description": "Report summarizing data analysis and findings for client presentations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Client’s evaluation of consulting outcomes and recommendations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Follow Up Meeting",
      "description": "Meeting between manager and client to discuss future collaboration."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Supervision": {
      "objects": [
        "Manager",
        "Consulting Project"
      ]
    },
    "Consulting": {
      "objects": [
        "Consultant",
        "Proposal",
        "Engagement Plan",
        "Feedback",
        "Progress Report"
      ]
    },
    "Analysis": {
      "objects": [
        "Reporter",
        "Data Report",
        "Analysis Session",
        "Consultant"
      ]
    },
    "Client Business": {
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Organization",
        "Follow Up Meeting"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Supervision": {
      "derived from": [
        "Supervision Subdomain",
        "Client Business Subdomain"
      ],
      "objects": [
        "Manager",
        "Consulting Project",
        "Client",
        "Organization",
        "Follow Up Meeting"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Consulting": {
      "derived from": "Consulting Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Consultant",
        "Proposal",
        "Engagement Plan",
        "Feedback",
        "Progress Report"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Analysis": {
      "derived from": "Analysis Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Reporter",
        "Data Report",
        "Analysis Session",
        "Analyst"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Consultant -> Analyst"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
